---
title: "confirm_request (Sui Framework: transfer_policy)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: TransferRequest destructured to (item, paid, from, receipts)
    q_destruct --> q_get_rules: completed = receipts.into_keys()
    q_get_rules --> q_check_count: total = completed.length()
    q_check_count --> q_abort_count: total != self.rules.length()
    q_abort_count --> [*]: abort EPolicyNotSatisfied
    q_check_count --> q_loop: counts match
    q_loop --> q_check_rule: while total > 0
    q_check_rule --> q_abort_rule: rule_type not in self.rules
    q_abort_rule --> [*]: abort EIllegalRule
    q_check_rule --> q_loop: rule valid, total = total - 1
    q_loop --> [*]: return (item, paid, from)

    note right of q_check_count
        INV-001: number of receipts must exactly match number of rules
        INV-002: each receipt must correspond to a rule in the policy
        INV-003: TransferRequest is consumed (hot potato resolved)
        INV-004: receipt types are checked by TypeName (type-safe)
    end note
